### Liquor POS – REST Client scratchpad (install "humao.rest-client")
@base = http://localhost:4000/api

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Login (run this first – captures the token)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Current user
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Products
GET {{base}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Low stock
GET {{base}}/inventory/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard summary
GET {{base}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Checkout a sale
POST {{base}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Walk-in",
  "discount": 0,
  "items":    [{ "product_id": 1, "quantity": 2 }, { "product_id": 2, "quantity": 3 }],
  "payments": [{ "payment_method": "cash", "amount": 3480, "amount_received": 4000 }]
}

### Sales history
GET {{base}}/sales?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stock movement
POST {{base}}/inventory/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "product_id": 3, "transaction_type": "stock_in", "quantity": 12, "notes": "Weekly delivery" }
